      "<span style=\"color:#85cab7\"><b>Power of Ambition</b></span>",
      "",
      "<span style=\"color:#5db69e\"><i><small>Equippable on Fusion Rifles, Grenade Launchers, Glaives, Sidearms, SMGs, and Swords.</small></i></span>"
    ],
    [],
    [],
    [
      "<span style=\"color:#85cab7\"><b>Blight Rounds</b></span> <span style=\"color:#5db69e\"><b>is triggered through a Weapon Archetype based Counter System that progresses by dealing damage multiple times within ? seconds of each damage instance, activating upon reaching</b></span> <span style=\"color:#85cab7\"><b>100% progress</b></span><span style=\"color:#5db69e\"><b>.</b></span>",
      "",
      "<span style=\"color:#85cab7\"><b>Counter Progress per damage instance:</b></span>",
      "<span style=\"color:#93c47d\"><b>Grenade Launcher</b></span><span style=\"color:#5db69e\"><b>: ~3.4% (~30 hits)</b></span>",
      "<span style=\"color:#b7b7b7\"><b>Submachine Gun</b></span><span style=\"color:#5db69e\"><b>: 3.85% (26 hits)</b></span>",
      "<span style=\"color:#93c47d\"><b>Fusion Rifle</b></span><span style=\"color:#5db69e\"><b>: 7.15% (14 hits)</b></span>",
      "<span style=\"color:#cccccc\"><b>Sidearm</b></span> <span style=\"color:#5db69e\"><b>and</b></span> <span style=\"color:#89cdd1\"><b>Glaive Melee</b></span><span style=\"color:#5db69e\"><b>: 10% (10 hits)</b></span>",
      "<span style=\"color:#93c47d\"><b>Glaive Projectile</b></span><span style=\"color:#5db69e\"><b>: 40% (3 hits)</b></span>",
      "",
      "<span style=\"color:#5db69e\"><i>Upon reaching</i> <b><i>100% Counter Progress</i></b><i>:</i></span>",
      "<span style=\"color:#5db69e\"><b>Grants</b></span> <span style=\"color:#a2c4c9\"><b>Blight Rounds</b></span> <span style=\"color:#5db69e\"><b>for 10 seconds.</b></span> <span style=\"color:#e06666\"><i>Buff cannot be refreshed</i></span><span style=\"color:#5db69e\"><i>.</i></span>",
      "",
      "<span style=\"color:#5db69e\"><i>While</i></span> <span style=\"color:#85cab7\"><b><i>Blight Rounds</i></b></span> <span style=\"color:#5db69e\"><i>is active:</i></span>",
      "<span style=\"color:#5db69e\"><b>Dealing Weapon Damage inflicts</b></span> <span style=\"color:#a2c4c9\"><b>Blighted.</b></span> <span style=\"color:#89cdd1\"><i>Glaive Melee</i></span> <span style=\"color:#e06666\"><i>cannot</i></span> <span style=\"color:#5db69e\"><i>inflict</i></span> <span style=\"color:#a2c4c9\"><i>Blight</i></span><span style=\"color:#5db69e\"><i>.</i></span>",
      "<span style=\"color:#a2c4c9\"><b>Blighted</b></span> <span style=\"color:#5db69e\"><b>deals</b></span> <span style=\"color:#a4c2f4\"><b>5</b></span> <span style=\"color:#ea9999\"><b>[8]</b></span> <span style=\"color:#d5a6bd\"><b>Element-Matching Weapon Damage</b></span> <span style=\"color:#5db69e\"><b>every 0.267 seconds, up to 7 times over 2 seconds after a 0.48 second delay.</b></span>",
      "<span style=\"color:#a2c4c9\"><b>Blighted duration</b></span> <span style=\"color:#5db69e\"><b>can be refreshed by</b></span> <span style=\"color:#a2c4c9\"><b>Blight damage ticks</b></span><span style=\"color:#5db69e\"><b>, to a maximum of</b></span> <span style=\"color:#a2c4c9\"><b>45 ticks.</b></span>",
      "<span style=\"color:#a2c4c9\"><b>Blighted</b></span> <span style=\"color:#5db69e\"><b>inflicts</b></span> <span style=\"color:#b4a7d6\"><b>Disruption</b></span><span style=\"color:#5db69e\"><b>,</b></span> <span style=\"color:#9fc5e8\"><b>stunning</b></span> <span style=\"color:#b4a7d6\"><b>Overload Champions</b></span> <span style=\"color:#5db69e\"><b>and</b></span> <span style=\"color:#dd7e6b\"><b>exhausting</b></span><span style=\"color:#5db69e\"><b>.</b></span>",
      "<span style=\"color:#a4c2f4\"><i>DoT against Combatants scales with Combatant Rank Modifiers and other buffs.</i></span>",
      "",
      "<span style=\"color:#5db69e\"><b>Passively grants</b></span> <span style=\"color:#a4c2f4\"><b>Overcharge</b></span> <span style=\"color:#5db69e\"><b>to the weapon when said modifier is active.</b></span>",
      "<span style=\"color:#5db69e\"><i>No interactions with</i></span> <span style=\"color:#ffd966\"><i>Necrotic Grips</i></span><span style=\"color:#5db69e\"><i>, or any other</i></span> <span style=\"color:#6aa84f\"><i>Poison</i></span><span style=\"color:#5db69e\"><i>.</i></span>"
    ]
