    [
      "<span style=\"color:#85cab7\"><b>Guardians in the Nether are passively granted</b></span> <span style=\"color:#dd7e6b\"><b>+75 Health (145)</b></span> <span style=\"color:#85cab7\"><b>and</b></span> <span style=\"color:#7cadff\"><b>+300 Shields (415 - 430)</b></span><span style=\"color:#85cab7\"><b>, increasing the</b></span> <span style=\"color:#dd7e6b\"><b>total health pool</b></span> <span style=\"color:#85cab7\"><b>to</b></span> <span style=\"color:#dd7e6b\"><b>560</b> <i><small>(T0 Resilience)</small></i></span> <span style=\"color:#85cab7\"><b>–</b></span> <span style=\"color:#dd7e6b\"><b>575 HP</b> <i><small>(T10 Resilience)</small></i></span><span style=\"color:#85cab7\"><b>, but possess</b></span> <span style=\"color:#dd7e6b\"><b>no health regeneration</b></span><span style=\"color:#85cab7\"><b>.</b></span>",
      "<span style=\"color:#85cab7\"><b>Most means of</b></span> <span style=\"color:#dd7e6b\"><b>restoring HP</b></span><span style=\"color:#cccccc\"><b>/</b></span><span style=\"color:#d5a6bd\"><b>Gaining Overshields</b></span> <span style=\"color:#cccccc\"><b>are</b></span> <span style=\"color:#e06666\"><b>reduced</b></span> <span style=\"color:#cccccc\"><b>by</b></span> <span style=\"color:#e06666\"><b>70%</b></span><span style=\"color:#cccccc\"><b>.</b></span>",
      "",
      "<span style=\"color:#a4c2f4\"><b>Revive Tokens</b></span> <span style=\"color:#85cab7\"><b>are limited, with an initial amount determined by the</b></span> <span style=\"color:#a4c2f4\"><b>Activity Difficulty</b></span><span style=\"color:#85cab7\"><b>.</b></span>",
      "<span style=\"color:#a4c2f4\"><b>Explore = 18 | Advanced+ = 9</b></span><span style=\"color:#85cab7\"><b>.</b></span>",
      "<span style=\"color:#85cab7\"><b>Additional</b></span> <span style=\"color:#a4c2f4\"><b>Revive Tokens</b></span> <span style=\"color:#85cab7\"><b>can be randomly acquired by breaking</b></span> <span style=\"color:#ead1dc\"><b>pots</b></span> <span style=\"color:#85cab7\"><b>and opening chests.</b></span>",
      "",
      "<span style=\"color:#a4c2f4\"><b>Famine Modifier</b></span> <span style=\"color:#85cab7\"><b>is active.</b></span>",
      "<span style=\"color:#85cab7\"><b>Additional</b></span> <span style=\"color:#93c47d\"><b>Special</b></span> <span style=\"color:#85cab7\"><b>and</b></span> <span style=\"color:#a481e1\"><b>Heavy</b></span> <span style=\"color:#85cab7\"><b>Ammo can be obtained by breaking</b></span> <span style=\"color:#ead1dc\"><b>pots</b></span><span style=\"color:#85cab7\"><b>.</b></span>",
      "",
      "<span style=\"color:#dd7e6b\"><b>Health Orbs</b></span> <span style=\"color:#85cab7\"><b>are obtained by defeating</b></span> <span style=\"color:#a4c2f4\"><b>Combatants</b></span> <span style=\"color:#85cab7\"><b>and breaking</b></span> <span style=\"color:#ead1dc\"><b>pots</b></span><span style=\"color:#85cab7\"><b>.</b></span>",
      "<span style=\"color:#dd7e6b\"><b>Health Orbs restore ? HP</b></span> <span style=\"color:#85cab7\"><b>on pickup.</b></span>",
      "",
      "<span style=\"color:#f1c232\"><b>Power Level</b></span> <span style=\"color:#85cab7\"><b>in the Nether:</b></span>",
      "<span style=\"color:#85cab7\"><b>The first stage of every run will have a</b></span> <span style=\"color:#f1c232\"><b>0 PL Delta</b></span><span style=\"color:#85cab7\"><b>, regardless of the selected</b></span> <span style=\"color:#a4c2f4\"><b>difficulty</b></span><span style=\"color:#85cab7\"><b>.</b></span>",
      "<span style=\"color:#85cab7\"><b>Clearing a stage</b> <i><small>(Defeating the boss)</small></i> <b>will progress to the next</b></span> <span style=\"color:#f1c232\"><b>PL Delta</b></span> <span style=\"color:#85cab7\"><b>tier.</b></span>",
      "",
      "<span style=\"color:#93c47d\"><b>Explore</b></span> <span style=\"color:#85cab7\"><b>= 0 | -5 |</b></span> <span style=\"color:#f4cccc\"><b>-10⚔️</b></span>",
      "<span style=\"color:#6d9eeb\"><b>Advanced</b></span> <span style=\"color:#85cab7\"><b>= 0 |</b></span> <span style=\"color:#f4cccc\"><b>-10⚔️</b></span> <span style=\"color:#85cab7\"><b>|</b></span> <span style=\"color:#ea9999\"><b>-20⚔️</b></span>",
      "<span style=\"color:#f6b26b\"><b>Expert</b></span> <span style=\"color:#85cab7\"><b>= 0 |</b></span> <span style=\"color:#ea9999\"><b>-20</b></span><span style=\"color:#85cab7\"><b>⚔️ |</b></span> <span style=\"color:#e06666\"><b>-40💀</b></span>"
